WEBVTT

01:06:56.500 --> 01:07:00.559
is that it betrays one reality
or it translates one reality,

01:07:00.583 --> 01:07:04.393
is that way too often these days
we bring the best of ourselves to work

01:07:04.417 --> 01:07:05.851
and the leftovers home.

01:07:05.875 --> 01:07:07.476
(Applause)

01:07:07.500 --> 01:07:11.601
This is where I do think
the word "work spouse" becomes relevant,

01:07:11.625 --> 01:07:13.268
but for the rest, no,

01:07:13.292 --> 01:07:15.559
find a word that --

01:07:15.583 --> 01:07:18.518
There's a lack of vocabulary
for this thing.

01:07:18.542 --> 01:07:20.917
You know, you're not married to them.

01:07:22.333 --> 01:07:25.559
Marriage is a whole lot
more complicated than that.

01:07:25.583 --> 01:07:29.434
AG: You start working with someone else,
you're also not cheating on them, right?

01:07:29.458 --> 01:07:30.768
EP: You know, it's a --